<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In `@code/core/src/manager-api/modules/layout.ts` around lines 260 - 268, The code
uses the loose check "tag in BUILT_IN_FILTERS" (seen in computeFilterFunctions
and the other occurrence) which will match prototype keys; change these to a
safe own-property check such as
Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(BUILT_IN_FILTERS, tag) so only actual
built-in keys are treated as built-ins; update both occurrences (the block in
computeFilterFunctions and the similar check around USER_TAG_FILTER usage) to
use this hasOwnProperty call and leave the existing push logic unchanged.
```

</details>

